    "titulo": "20th Renewable Energy World Exhibition & Forum",
    "descricao": "NEDO will exhibit at the “20th Renewable Energy World Exhibition & Forum”, which will be held at Tokyo Big Sight from Wednesday, January 28 to Friday, January 30, 2026. At this event, NEDO will present a booth showcasing renewable energy initiatives. This exhibition is Japan’s largest comprehensive event covering all fields of renewable energy and marks its 20th edition. At NEDO’s booth, under the theme “A Carbon-Neutral Future Created by Renewable Energy,” exhibits will be organized into categories such as Solar Energy, Wind Energy, Biomass Energy, Geothermal Power, Renewable Heat Utilization, Grid Interconnection, and Cross-disciplinary (Technology Incubation and Commercialization, International Activities). Through panels, videos, and exhibits, NEDO will provide clear and accessible information on the latest research achievements and policies in the renewable energy field. Dates: January 28 (Wed) – January 30 (Fri), 2026 Venue: Tokyo Big Sight, South Halls 1, 2 Admission: Free (Visitor registration is required to enter the exhibition hall. Please complete your registration in advance using the link below.) Registration: Click here to register for entry to the exhibition hall E-mail: NETDsoukatsu[*]nedo.go.jp Please replace [*] with @ when using the above email address. Department in Charge: Renewable Energy Department",
