    "titulo": "Moonshot Research and Development Program This page introduces NEDO's research and development activities, events, public offering information.",
    "descricao": "This is the website to introduce NEDO's research and development activities, events, public offering information, and so on, for achieving the Moonshot goal \"Realization of sustainable resource circulation to recover the global environment by 2050\" under the \"Moonshot Research and Development Program\" promoted through collaboration among related ministries and organizations. Outline of Moonshot R&D Program Outline of each R&D Projects The materials of the \"Moonshot Goal 4 Annual Session 2023 Program\" held on January 1 and February 2, 2024, have been posted. Moonshot Goal 4 Annual Session 2023 Program Moonshot Goal 4 Annual Session 2022 Program Videos introducing Moonshot Goal 4 have been posted on the NEDO channel! Program Director Dr. YAMAJI Kenji and 13 project managers introduce everything about Goal 4 and the details of each project in an easy-to-understand manner. These videos are a must-see for those interested in continuous resource circulation for the restoration of the global environment. Please take a look! English videos: NEDO Moonshot Goal4 Introduction Video Japanese videos: NEDOムーンショット目標4紹介動画 Short videos (Japanese): NEDOムーンショット目標4紹介ショート動画 The First International Symposium on \"Cool Earth via Microbes in Agriculture\" Presentation materials for December 17 Presentation materials for December 18",
